      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCKY TIME (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (31.14) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Can atone. GORDON KEEPING (4) shapes nicely here coming off an exceptional 30.37 victory at this track over 550m. Harder here but expected to feature again. HOOKED ON DOLLY (7) jumps from box 7 for the first time after placing latest at this track (30.81) in a Grade 5. Solid record here winning two races. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be in this for a long way. CASHED UP RHI (2) placed last time out so worth considering.",
